-- Seeds airlines from the legacy airline list (ref_id = legacy airline id where the old site had one).
-- Names drop the "(code)" suffix the legacy site appended. Logos are not part of the legacy list.
-- ids are UUID v4 generated by the seed script, so every environment gets the same ids.
-- create_by/update_by use the nil UUID for "system".

